    "description": "This lot includes a mixed assortment of raw mineral and gemstone specimens totaling approximately 323.1 grams. The collection features multiple pieces of black tourmaline (schorl), a green one wrapped with copper wire, and two large white and pink rough stones, pegmatite with pink tourmaline. Also included is a pair of dangle earrings made from black tourmaline set in metal findings. The tourmaline stones vary in color and size, measuring approximately 0.65 to 2.75 inches. All pieces are in raw, unpolished condition with varied shapes and sizes. Suitable for collectors, metaphysical enthusiasts, or jewelry makers. Please know the black tourmaline is showing flaking and chipping.\nGrab Bag/ Assortment Policy:\n\n*Some items may show more wear than others. Issues can include, but not limited to: Scuffs, chips, cracks, bends, kinks, missing components or needing repairs.\n\n*There is no guarantee on rarity or completeness of any sets that may be included in a grab bag / assortment.\n\n*Grab bags /Assortments come as is with no refunds or returns.\n\n*We are unable to answer questions about specific items within a grab bag/ assortment. Please view the provided photographs to determine general contents.\n\n*Due to the nature of donations used items may have unforeseen damage not noted in the description.",
